#15000
The King's Road~
   The King's Road begins here, broad and dead straight, its fitted stones
laid by masons whose skill nobody can match now. The levy carts have worn
two deep ruts down the middle of it. A tired carter trudges past toward the
west, his wagon full of tithe-grain, and does not look up. The road runs
east toward the castle and west to the lanes of Miden'Nir; a small overgrown
trail slips away south through the undergrowth.
~
